iki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Salving\" title=\"Ring of Salving\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Ring_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Salving\" title=\"Ring of Salving\">Ring of Salving</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Stun Immunity:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Stun Immunity does <i>not</i> protect against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunning_Gaze\" title=\"Stunning Gaze\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunning Gaze\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a hre